OL,3,GNEWSAWhat to expect from this year's
OL,4,AGreat North Run
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people are
OL,7,Fexpected to head to Tyneside next week
OL,8,Fin their attempts to tackle the Great
OL,9,FNorth Run.
OL,11,FIn its 45th year, the 13.1-mile (21km)
OL,12,Fevent involves runners and wheelchair
OL,13,Fusers beginning in Newcastle, racing
OL,14,Fthrough Gateshead and South Tyneside
OL,15,Fbefore finishing in South Shields on 13
OL,16,FSeptember.
OL,18,FSeveral road closures including the
OL,19,FA167 and A194 will be in place from
OL,20,F06:00 BST in central Newcastle, with
OL,21,Ftimes for closures in South Tyneside to
OL,22,Fbe released soon.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
